(7243016, 1123292, 175946, '<td valign="top">This was a great find for the challenge but the background killed this for me personally. Could not help but wonder what you might have been able to do with just the headlight and flat tire.</td>', 'This was a great find for the challenge but the background killed this for me personally. Could not help but wonder what you might have been able to do with just the headlight and flat tire.', '2014-07-21 21:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
