(7243097, 1123120, 156466, '<td valign="top">A moon shot has to be crisp.  Lots of CA here and not a lot of crisp lines.</td>', 'A moon shot has to be crisp.  Lots of CA here and not a lot of crisp lines.', '2014-07-22 07:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
