(7243101, 1123231, 156466, '<td valign="top">Just the right amount of clarity and structure.  Thanks for not going over the top.  It could stand a little touch up to remove the haloing around some of the edges.  7 that could have been higher.</td>', 'Just the right amount of clarity and structure.  Thanks for not going over the top.  It could stand a little touch up to remove the haloing around some of the edges.  7 that could have been higher.', '2014-07-22 08:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
