(7243103, 1123357, 156466, '<td valign="top">Vignette feels too tight - side feels like it should be a little brighter and I''m getting a huge hot spot in the middle that is distracting as heck.  Properly trated this could have been a lot higher than 5.</td>', 'Vignette feels too tight - side feels like it should be a little brighter and I''m getting a huge hot spot in the middle that is distracting as heck.  Properly trated this could have been a lot higher than 5.', '2014-07-22 08:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7243104, 1122451, 156466, '<td valign="top">A touch of blur to perhaps soften the bokeh?</td>', 'A touch of blur to perhaps soften the bokeh?', '2014-07-22 08:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7243105, 1123273, 156466, '<td valign="top">6.  I''m not sure if a pure B&amp;W or a different toner would have made me give it a 7, but I''m not crazy about this one.</td>', '6.  I''m not sure if a pure B&W or a different toner would have made me give it a 7, but I''m not crazy about this one.', '2014-07-22 08:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7243106, 1123330, 156466, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s just the way this site does verticals, but I''m thinking a crop down from the top to 4:5 might have been better. 6</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s just the way this site does verticals, but I''m thinking a crop down from the top to 4:5 might have been better. 6', '2014-07-22 08:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7243107, 1123180, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out if I''d prefer just a bit less shadow at the right edge or not.  My eye is saying "Yes", but I get that it''s supposed to disappear to nothingness.  Either way, I like it a lot. 8</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out if I''d prefer just a bit less shadow at the right edge or not.  My eye is saying "Yes", but I get that it''s supposed to disappear to nothingness.  Either way, I like it a lot. 8', '2014-07-22 08:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7243108, 1123324, 156466, '<td valign="top">I hate that I like how painterly this is.  Very 3-dimensional - almost portal like.  Very nice.</td>', 'I hate that I like how painterly this is.  Very 3-dimensional - almost portal like.  Very nice.', '2014-07-22 08:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7243109, 1122957, 156466, '<td valign="top">Needs a roll to the right.</td>', 'Needs a roll to the right.', '2014-07-22 08:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
